    accessibility: [
      "Every part renders its native element — table, caption, thead, tbody, tfoot, tr, th, td — so row/column semantics come from the browser.",
      "TableCaption names the table for assistive technology; prefer it over an aria-label.",
      "Header cells are real <th> elements scoped by native column association; no ARIA additions are needed.",
    ],
